03e85.30\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e75.31\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e81.44\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e75.37\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e76.39\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e72.77\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e82.70\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e75.84\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZhipu\u003c/strong\u003e is the top performer with an overall average of \u003cstrong\u003e88.29%\u003c/strong\u003e, and is the most robust on High/Medium difficulty content. \u003ccode\u003eN/A\u003c/code\u003e denotes task types not supported by the corresponding system (a true constraint rather than a missing evaluation). 95% bootstrap confidence intervals are typically tight (±2–5%), and an oracle-context QA test (answering from ground-truth source evidence) reaches 100% — observed failures reflect generated-slide content loss rather than evaluator error.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e🎨 Aesthetics\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--aesthetics\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🎨 Aesthetics\" href=\"#-aesthetics\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.