003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e0.53\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e0.26\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e17.8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHumans\u003c/strong\u003e (gold standard)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e0.85\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e0.12\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e45.3\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eSlidesGen-Bench achieves the highest Average Spearman correlation (0.71), substantially surpassing LLM-as-Judge Rating (0.57) and PPTAgent (0.53), with the most stable performance (Std = 0.16). LLM judges are powered by \u003ccode\u003egemini-3-flash-preview\u003c/code\u003e taking rendered slide images as direct inputs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e✏️ Editability: PEI Levels\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-️-editability-pei-levels\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ✏️ Editability: PEI Levels\" href=\"#️-editability-pei-levels\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eSystem\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eT1\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eT2\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eT3\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eT4\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eT5\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003ePEI\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePPTAgent\u003c/strong\u003e*\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL5\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutoPresent\u003c/strong\u003e*\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL4\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuark\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL3\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eGamma / Skywork / Kimi (Standard) / Kimi (Smart) / Zhipu\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eKimi (Banana) / Skywork (Banana)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✓\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotebookLM\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e✗\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eL0\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMost commercial systems achieve Level 2 (Vector Visual) but suffer from \u003cstrong\u003eStructural Amnesia\u003c/strong\u003e (no global masters). \u003cstrong\u003eQuark\u003c/strong\u003e is the sole commercial system to breach the \"Toy-to-Tool\" threshold (L3); the Parametric Gap (L4) is bridged only by open-source academic frameworks (AutoPresent*), while PPTAgent* reaches L5 by inheriting temporal dynamics from raw templates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n  \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/YunqiaoYang/SlidesGen-Bench/blob/main/images/V-E.jpg\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/YunqiaoYang/SlidesGen-Bench/raw/main/images/V-E.jpg\" alt=\"V-E (Visual-Editability) Matrix\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eV-E Matrix\u003c/strong\u003e maps systems by visual aesthetics (x-axis) and editability (y-axis). Commercial systems dominate the left hemisphere (L0–L2), while the lower-right quadrant (Q4) houses Quark, AutoPresent*, and PPTAgent*. The upper-right quadrant (Q1) remains vacant — no current system achieves peak performance in both dimensions simultaneously.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📊 Slides-Align1.5k Dataset\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--slides-align15k-dataset\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📊 Slides-Align1.5k Dataset\" href=\"#-slides-align15k-dataset\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Yqy6/Slides-Align\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\n    \u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ee549bed9a6f4394cc756c617506634963adfffbe00ac9f5967590bbc1ae7d50/68747470733a2f2f68756767696e67666163652e636f2f64617461736574732f68756767696e67666163652f6261646765732f7265736f6c76652f6d61696e2f646174617365742d6f6e2d68662d736d2e737667\" alt=\"Dataset on HF\" data-canonical-src=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/huggingface/badges/resolve/main/dataset-on-hf-sm.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWe release \u003cstrong\u003eSlides-Align1.5k\u003c/strong\u003e, a human preference dataset for evaluating AI-generated slide presentations, constructed as a ground-truth testbed for validating automated evaluation schemes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n  🤗 \u003ca href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Yqy6/Slides-Align\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ehuggingface.co/datasets/Yqy6/Slides-Align\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📈 Dataset Statistics\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--dataset-statistics\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📈 Dataset Statistics\" href=\"#-dataset-statistics\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable align=\"center\"\u003e\n  \u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\n    \u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📊 Human Preference Rankings\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e~1,500\u003c/td\u003e\n    \u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏢 Systems Evaluated\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e11 (9 commercial + 2 academic)\u003c/td\u003e\n    \u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📂 Scenario Categories\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e7\u003c/td\u003e\n    \u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💡 Benchmark Instructions\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e189\u003c/td\u003e\n  \u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📝 Benchmark Instruction Distribution\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--benchmark-instruction-distribution\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📝 Benchmark Instruction Distribution\" href=\"#-benchmark-instruction-distribution\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe benchmark contains \u003cstrong\u003e189\u003c/strong\u003e curated instructions, each a complex, document-level synthesis task (mean: 4,525 characters, requiring multi-modal image integration):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eCategory\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"center\"\u003eInstructions\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eDescription\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003etopic_introduction\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e94\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e📚 General topic introductions (AI, Climate Change, 5G, etc.)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eproduct_launch\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e24\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🚀 Product launch announcements\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003epersonal_statement\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e20\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e👤 Personal statements and self-introductions\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003ebrand_promote\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e📢 Brand promotion and marketing\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003ecourse_preparation\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e15\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🎓 Educational course materials\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003ework_report\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e13\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e📊 Work progress reports\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003ebusiness_plan\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"center\"\u003e8\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e💼 Business plan presentations\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eInstructions are further stratified into three balanced \u003cstrong\u003eContent Richness\u003c/strong\u003e levels (Low / Medium / High, 63 each), where \"High\" richness demands organizing 7,500+ characters and 20+ images into cohesive decks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e🏢 Systems Evaluated\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--systems-evaluated\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🏢 Systems Evaluated\" href=\"#-systems-evaluated\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe evaluated systems span three generation paradigms:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSource File Generation\u003c/strong\u003e — directly outputs standard \u003ccode\u003e.pptx\u003c/code\u003e files (template-filling or code-centric manipulation).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHTML Code Generation\u003c/strong\u003e — LLMs synthesize structural code (HTML/CSS/JS) for superior typographic precision.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage Generation\u003c/strong\u003e — multi-modal models generate slides directly as images.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eProduct\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eProvider\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eParadigm\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth align=\"left\"\u003eDescription\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGamma\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eGamma.com.ai\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (template)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🎨 AI presentation maker\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuark PPT\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eQuark AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (template)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e⚡ Quark presentation tool\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKimi-Standard\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eMoonshot AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (template)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🌙 Kimi-PPT (standard mode)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKimi-Smart\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eMoonshot AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (template)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🧠 Kimi-PPT (smart mode)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZhipu\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eZhipu AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eHTML code generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🤖 Presentation generator\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkywork\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSKYWORK.ai\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eHTML code generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🌤️ Skywork AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotebookLM\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eGoogle\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eImage generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e📓 AI notebook with presentation generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkywork-Banana\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSKYWORK.ai\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eImage generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🍌 Skywork (Banana mode)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKimi-Banana\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eMoonshot AI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eImage generation\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🍌 Kimi (Banana mode)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePPTAgent\u003c/strong\u003e*\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eAcademic (open-source)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (template)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🎓 Adapted academic framework\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutoPresent\u003c/strong\u003e*\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eAcademic (open-source)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003eSource file (code)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd align=\"left\"\u003e🎓 Adapted academic framework\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eAdapted open-source pipelines (marked with \u003ccode\u003e*\u003c/code\u003e) were augmented with LLM pre-processing/routing to run under the benchmark's zero-shot, end-to-end setting.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e👤 Human Annotation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--human-annotation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 👤 Human Annotation\" href=\"#-human-annotation\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiverse annotator pool\u003c/strong\u003e: CS Ph.D. students, art undergraduates, and office clerks, providing technical, aesthetic, and end-user perspectives.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRanking interface\u003c/strong\u003e: a web-based annotation interface presents high-resolution rendered slide images from competing systems for the same input; annotators rank decks from best to worst (relative ranking rather than absolute scores).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh agreement\u003c/strong\u003e: inter-annotator agreement reaches an Average Spearman correlation of \u003cstrong\u003e0.85\u003c/strong\u003e (Std = 0.12), serving as a reliable gold standard.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📝 Annotation Format\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--annotation-format\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📝 Annotation Format\" href=\"#-annotation-format\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eClick to expand annotation example\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n    \u0026quot;results\u0026quot;: [\n        {\n            \u0026quot;product\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;NotebookLM\u0026quot;,\n            \u0026quot;difficulty\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;topic_introduction\u0026quot;,\n            \u0026quot;topic\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;FinTech\u0026quot;,\n            \u0026quot;rank\u0026quot;: 1\n        },\n        ...\n    ]\n}\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e{\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"results\"\u003c/span\u003e: [\n        {\n            \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"product\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003eNotebookLM\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,\n            \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"difficulty\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003etopic_introduction\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,\n            \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"topic\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003eFinTech\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,\n            \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\"rank\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\n        },\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-ii\"\u003e...\u003c/span\u003e\n    ]\n}\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e💻 Usage\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--usage\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 💻 Usage\" href=\"#-usage\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-python notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"from datasets import load_dataset\n\n# Load from Hugging Face\ndataset = load_dataset(\u0026quot;Yqy6/Slides-Align\u0026quot;)\n\n# Access the data\nfor item in dataset['train']:\n    print(f\u0026quot;{item['product']} - {item['topic']}: Rank {item['rank']}\u0026quot;)\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003efrom\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003edatasets\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eimport\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eload_dataset\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Load from Hugging Face\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003edataset\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-en\"\u003eload_dataset\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"Yqy6/Slides-Align\"\u003c/span\u003e)\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Access the data\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003efor\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eitem\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003ein\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003edataset\u003c/span\u003e[\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e'train'\u003c/span\u003e]:\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-en\"\u003eprint\u003c/span\u003e(\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003ef\"\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eitem\u003c/span\u003e[\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e'product'\u003c/span\u003e]\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e - \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eitem\u003c/span\u003e[\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e'topic'\u003c/span\u003e]\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e: Rank \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eitem\u003c/span\u003e[\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e'rank'\u003c/span\u003e]\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e🔧 Adding Your Own Products\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--adding-your-own-products\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔧 Adding Your Own Products\" href=\"#-adding-your-own-products\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eYou can easily extend SlidesGen-Bench to evaluate your own slide generation product by following these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e1️⃣ Configure Product Settings\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-1️⃣-configure-product-settings\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 1️⃣ Configure Product Settings\" href=\"#1️⃣-configure-product-settings\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eAdd your product configuration to \u003ccode\u003eeval/eval_config.py\u003c/code\u003e in the \u003ccode\u003ePRODUCTS\u003c/code\u003e dictionary:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-python notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"PRODUCTS = {\n    # ... existing products ...\n    \u0026quot;YourProduct\u0026quot;: {\n        \u0026quot;directory\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;YourProduct\u0026quot;,           # Folder name in ppt_gen_root\n        \u0026quot;input_format\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;pptx\u0026quot;,               # Format: \u0026quot;pptx\u0026quot; or \u0026quot;pdf\u0026quot;\n        \u0026quot;description\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;Your product description\u0026quot;,\n        \u0026quot;structure\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;difficulty/topic/name\u0026quot;, # Directory structure\n        \u0026quot;has_slide_images\u0026quot;: False,            # Set True if images pre-extracted\n    },\n}\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003ePRODUCTS\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e {\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# ... existing products ...\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"YourProduct\"\u003c/span\u003e: {\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"directory\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"YourProduct\"\u003c/span\u003e,           \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Folder name in ppt_gen_root\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"input_format\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"pptx\"\u003c/span\u003e,               \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Format: \"pptx\" or \"pdf\"\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"description\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"Your product description\"\u003c/span\u003e,\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"structure\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"difficulty/topic/name\"\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Directory structure\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\"has_slide_images\"\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eFalse\u003c/span\u003e,            \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e# Set True if images pre-extracted\u003c/span\u003e\n    },\n}\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e2️⃣ Organize Your Slides\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-2️⃣-organize-your-slides\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 2️⃣ Organize Your Slides\" href=\"#2️⃣-organize-your-slides\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eStructure your generated slides following the specified format:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"ppt_gen_root/\n└── YourProduct/\n    └── {difficulty}/              # e.g., topic_introduction, work_report\n        └── {topic}/               # e.g., AI, Climate_Change\n            └── slides.pptx        # Your generated presentation\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eppt_gen_root/\n└── YourProduct/\n    └── {difficulty}/              # e.g., topic_introduction, work_report\n        └── {topic}/               # e.g., AI, Climate_Change\n            └── slides.pptx        # Your generated presentation\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupported difficulties:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003etopic_introduction\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ework_report\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ebusiness_plan\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ebrand_promote\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003epersonal_statement\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eproduct_launch\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ecourse_preparation\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e3️⃣ Preprocess Slides\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-3️⃣-preprocess-slides\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 3️⃣ Preprocess Slides\" href=\"#3️⃣-preprocess-slides\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eConvert your slides to images for unified evaluation:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# For PPTX files\npython eval/pre_process.py --ppt-gen-root ./your_slides_folder --products YourProduct\n\n# For custom formats, adapt the conversion script:\n# python eval/process_custom.py --product-dir your_product_dir\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e For PPTX files\u003c/span\u003e\npython eval/pre_process.py --ppt-gen-root ./your_slides_folder --products YourProduct\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e For custom formats, adapt the conversion script:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e python eval/process_custom.py --product-dir your_product_dir\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e4️⃣ Run Evaluation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-4️⃣-run-evaluation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 4️⃣ Run Evaluation\" href=\"#4️⃣-run-evaluation\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eEvaluate your product using the benchmark:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Content evaluation\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --eval-mode content_only \\\n  --workers 4\n\n# Aesthetics evaluation\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --eval-mode aesthetics_only\n\n# Full evaluation\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --source-mode all \\\n  --workers 4\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e Content evaluation\u003c/span\u003e\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --eval-mode content_only \\\n  --workers 4\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e Aesthetics evaluation\u003c/span\u003e\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --eval-mode aesthetics_only\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e Full evaluation\u003c/span\u003e\npython eval/quantitative_eval.py \\\n  --products YourProduct \\\n  --source-mode all \\\n  --workers 4\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📌 Tips\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--tips\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📌 Tips\" href=\"#-tips\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e✅ Ensure slide images are stored in \u003ccode\u003e{ppt_path}_images/\u003c/code\u003e folders\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e✅ Use consistent naming conventions across topics\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e✅ Set \u003ccode\u003ehas_slide_images: True\u003c/code\u003e if you've already extracted slide images\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e✅ Test with a small subset before running full evaluation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e⚙️ Configuration\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-️-configuration\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚙️ Configuration\" href=\"#️-configuration\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eConfiguration options can be set via:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e📝 Config file: \u003ccode\u003eeval/eval_config.py\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e💻 Command-line arguments\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e📄 Citation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content--citation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📄 Citation\" href=\"#-citation\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIf you find SlidesGen-Bench useful in your research, please consider citing our paper:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-text-bibtex notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"@misc{yang2026slidesgenbenchevaluatingslidesgeneration,\n      title={SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics}, \n      author={Yunqiao Yang and Wenbo Li and Houxing Ren and Zimu Lu and Ke Wang and Zhiyuan Huang and Zhuofan Zong and Mingjie Zhan and Hongsheng Li},\n      year={2026},\n      eprint={2601.09487},\n      archivePrefix={arXiv},\n      primaryClass={cs.CL},\n      url={https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.09487}, \n}\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e@misc\u003c/span\u003e{\u003cspan class=\"pl-en\"\u003eyang2026slidesgenbenchevaluatingslidesgeneration\u003c/span\u003e,\n      \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003etitle\u003c/span\u003e=\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003eSlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, \n      \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003eauthor\u003c/span\u003e=\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003eYunqiao Yang and Wenbo Li and Houxing Ren and Zimu Lu and Ke Wang and Zhiyuan Huang and Zhuofan Zong and Mingjie Zhan and Hongsheng Li\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,\n      \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003eyear\u003c/span\u003e=\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e{\u003c/span