<td align="left"><strong>LLM Rating</strong></td>
<td align="left">Direct scoring by language models</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left"><strong>LLM Arena</strong></td>
<td align="left">Pairwise comparison with ELO ranking</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<blockquote>
