<p dir="auto"><strong>Zhipu</strong> is the top performer with an overall average of <strong>88.29%</strong>, and is the most robust on High/Medium difficulty content. <code>N/A</code> denotes task types not supported by the corresponding system (a true constraint rather than a missing evaluation). 95% bootstrap confidence intervals are typically tight (±2–5%), and an oracle-context QA test (answering from ground-truth source evidence) reaches 100% — observed failures reflect generated-slide content loss rather than evaluator error.</p>
